罷兵佗因此以兵威財物賂遺閩粤¶","source_blob_sha":"b41576d7d677e481940c3a7f222a09837c85e8f7","response_sha256":"ae85076fbcb902242dad85fc3d8b11751e408d228b939c73e8f4c3ee4a879793","response_extent":{"first_line":151,"last_line":300,"partial_file":true},"image_verified":false,"quote":"師古曰周竈也","scope":"ancient_commentary_identity_or_name_components","note":"短引文只除分行、雙行注斜線、括號、段末符與頁標；保留原字。部分回應指紋非全檔hash，Git blob另列。古注亦非影像校勘。"},{"title":"《高祖功臣侯者年表》隆慮列","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷018&oldid=9484995","quote":"七。六年正月丁未，哀侯周灶元年。","table_id":"shiji-018","table_cell_id":"shiji-018-t1-r026-c02","scope":"received_same_fief_full_name","image_verified":false}],"rationale":"本篇隆慮侯灶表作周灶、漢書注周竈；樊酈篇灶為夏侯嬰子、承汝陰侯，家世與封國不同，不因同名灶合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:p021","text":"嬰自上初起沛，常為太僕，竟高祖崩。以太僕事孝惠。孝惠帝及高后德嬰之脫孝惠、魯元於下邑之閒也，乃賜嬰縣北第第一，曰「近我」，以尊異之。孝惠帝崩，以太僕事高后。高后崩，代王之來，嬰以太僕與東牟侯入清宮，廢少帝，以天子法駕迎代王代邸，與大臣共立為孝文皇帝，復為太僕。八歲卒，謚為文侯。子夷侯灶立，七年卒。子共侯賜立，三十一年卒。子侯頗尚平陽公主。立十九歲，元鼎二年，坐與父御婢姦罪，自殺，國除。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m021-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"li9_cmb_8ci","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m021-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m021-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"孝惠","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m021-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"孝惠帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m021-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"高后","kind":"person","person_id":"i30_mjq_6q8_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m021-0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"li9_cm